Job:SweepOpenFOAMSet(SweepOptions:opts, SweepOpenFOAMSet:cases)
{
    SweepPlan:plan = Sweep.Plan(opts, cases);
    SweepState:state = Sweep.InitState(plan);
    Int:chunks = Sweep.ChunkCount(plan);
    FoamTaskCollection:tasks;
    FoamResultCollection:wave;

    ~ A case set: every variant is its own ready case, carried by the plan
      beside the study, whose OpenFOAM block holds what the cases share.
      Progressive chunks as for a single case: each pass takes the next slice
      of the variant table, fans it out to Foam.Run, and checkpoints
      everything harvested so far into the manifest blob the state points at.
      A monitoring client polls the state; whatever it has read survives
      cancellation. ~
    Loop(chunks)
    {
        tasks = Sweep.MakeChunk(plan, state);
        wave = Grid.ForEach(task in tasks) => Foam.Run(task);
        state = Sweep.Harvest(plan, state, wave);
    }

    Blob:manifest = Sweep.Finish(plan, state);
    Return(manifest);
}
